    <briefdescription>
<para>XML parsing class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An object of type <ref refid="classXMLUtil_1_1XMLParser" kindref="compound">XMLParser</ref> uses Xerces-C to parse an XML document. The parser uses <ref refid="classXMLUtil_1_1XMLHandler" kindref="compound">XMLHandler</ref> to create an XML element tree whose nodes are of type TreeNode&lt;XMLHandler::Elem&gt;. See <ref refid="classXMLUtil_1_1XMLHandler" kindref="compound">XMLHandler</ref> for more details on the structure of this tree. </para>    </detaileddescription>
